{"version":1,"key":"card:149","content":{"id":149,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b7b72265-eed3-498d-bc04-15d1a841abf0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"childList"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来监听子元素的变化。当 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"options"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"childList"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"true"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，表示监听子元素的变化，即子元素的新增与删除。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"2efcc8ae-0a2a-4f52-a57f-b7f427a92f97","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"70c247e2-fb43-494a-9b00-ea06c085273c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<div id=\"container\">\n  <p>世界这么大，我想去看看</p>\n</div>\n<button id=\"btn\">删除/新增</button>","collabId":"0b23bd5b-8e11-4732-b8f0-3fab025830e7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"cda62bc0-efe5-4a22-8e8a-7d40381b18af","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"bb81f2fc-4e10-4090-81a5-a436391a8d91","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const container = document.querySelector('#container');\nconst observer = new MutationObserver(mutations => {\n  console.log(mutations);\n});\nobserver.observe(container, {\n  childList: true\n});\n\nconst btn = document.querySelector('#btn');\nbtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  const p = container.querySelector('p');\n  if (p) {\n    container.removeChild(p);\n  } else {\n    container.innerHTML = '<p>世界这么大，我想去看看</p>';\n  }\n});","collabId":"17d6f14e-373a-4b5c-acaa-b43761c65b32","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3f1f9803-0be0-469c-94e4-fd0d0f6ac984","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"MutationRecord"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"addedNodes"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"removedNodes"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性可以访问到添加的节点以及删除的节点。通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nextSibling"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"prevSibling"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以获得被删除或新增节点的前后兄弟节点（如果不存在则为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"null"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"6654eede-075c-40c7-a34c-51ea95a30dd2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6bdfbe63-ae77-4f52-a87d-c600e4b7c81d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const observer = new MutationObserver(mutations => {\n  mutations.forEach(mutation => {\n    console.log(mutation.addedNodes);\n    console.log(mutation.removedNodes);\n  })\n});\nobserver.observe(container, {\n  childList: true\n});","collabId":"7e7c9372-19e1-4bcd-a9c6-39d4d491097e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"760db7eb-732c-4050-9bd5-27e683423d44","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要注意的是，"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"设置 "},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"code":true,"text":"childList"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"code":true,"text":"true"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"，只能监听直接子元素的新增与删除，对于更深层次的子元素的变化无法监听"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。那有没有办法进行深层次的监听呢？答案是有，需要配合 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"subtree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性。除了需要指定 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"childList"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"true"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 以外还需要指定 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"subtree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"true"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"a99bccce-8107-4c53-b6ea-825d31643b36","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e7e09068-567a-458a-88c2-0e03a3a62eb1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const observer = new MutationObserver(mutations => {\n  console.log(mutations);\n});\nobserver.observe(container, {\n  childList: true,\n  subtree: true\n});","collabId":"d93d82b2-e1a6-4a3a-ae51-ea6c6049afc0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["DOM/Mutation Observer"],"createTime":1690160295132,"updateTime":1743303640404,"linkedCards":[{"id":148,"target":{"key":"card:148","type":"card","id":148},"summary":"在复杂的网页应用中，DOM 结构会频繁的发生变化，有的时候我们需要根据变化来进行相应的操作，以往通过 Mutation Events 来监听 DOM 的变化，目前它已经废弃了，被 MutationObserver 所取代。 Mutation...","tags":["DOM/Mutation Observer"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640404}}